    "updated_at": "2020-08-02T08:09:50Z",
    "body": "There is a work around for this by using the [`python_binary`](https://starship.rs/config/#python) configuration option to tell Starship to use a different python binary to get the version e.g\r\n```toml\r\n[python]\r\npython_binary = 'python3'\r\n```",
